123317,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P3_ChainOfThought,1,1,"The PR updates the version of the 'github/codeql-action/upload-sarif' dependency from 4.36.2 to 4.37.0. The update includes several bug fixes and improvements, such as fixing a race condition in the service index and addressing issues with diagnostic overwrites on disk. There are no potential bugs or breaking changes mentioned in the PR description. The changelog provides details about the updates, and Dependabot has resolved any conflicts.",MERGE,5.89
123317,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P4_RoleBased,1,1,"The update to version 4.37.0 of the github/codeql-action/upload-sarif package includes several improvements and bug fixes, such as better compatibility with various registry implementations, a fix for potential data loss when multiple diagnostics are produced within the same millisecond, and an updated default bundle. These changes are likely beneficial for maintaining the security and functionality of code quality analysis in GitHub Actions workflows.",MERGE,4.07
