140784,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P1_ZeroShot,0,1,"The PR introduces a new e2e_node test for validating CRI container metrics when the `PodAndContainerStatsFromCRI` feature gate is enabled. This complements existing tests and addresses a specific KEP (Kubernetes Enhancement Proposal). The test structure and helper functions are well-documented, and it depends on another PR that adds necessary labels to the CRI metrics collector. The timeout for the new test is appropriately set higher than the existing cadvisor test to account for potential delays in metric collection.",MERGE,13.45
