140784,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P3_ChainOfThought,0,1,"The PR introduces a new e2e_node test for validating container metrics when the `PodAndContainerStatsFromCRI` feature gate is enabled. The test checks per-container CPU, memory, filesystem, and process metrics, pod-level network metrics, and ensures that the `kubelet_metrics_provider` metric reports `provider=cri`. It also depends on another PR to add namespace, pod, and container labels to the CRI metrics collector.",MERGE,10.98
140784,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P4_RoleBased,0,1,"The PR introduces an e2e_node test for validating container metrics when the `PodAndContainerStatsFromCRI` feature gate is enabled. This test complements existing tests and ensures that the CRI metrics collection path works correctly. The test covers per-container CPU, memory, filesystem, and process metrics, as well as pod-level network metrics and a specific metric provider report.",MERGE,11.15
