140659,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P1_ZeroShot,0,1,"The PR introduces a new feature that can help with debugging in-place pod resizing and other issues with pod updates. It also simplifies a feature that is landing in v1.37. The feature is primarily intended for human-facing debug endpoints rather than something that controllers depend on, so it does not introduce any significant changes to the API server or controllers. The PR has been reviewed by multiple people and there are no major issues with the code. Therefore, I believe this PR will be MERGED.",MERGE,5.43
140659,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P2_FewShot,0,1,"The PR introduces a new feature that can help with debugging in-place pod resizing and other issues with pod updates. The addition of a defensive check against None values in the code is also good practice. However, the PR description mentions that this feature was originally proposed as part of a KEP that has not yet been merged. This could be a potential concern for merging the PR into v1.37.",MERGE,4.85
140659,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P3_ChainOfThought,0,1,"The PR introduces a new read-only `/allocated` subresource on pods, which surfaces the allocated pod spec directly from the Kubelet. This change is intended to simplify debugging in-place pod resizing and other issues with pod updates. The PR also includes changes to the Kubelet to serve this new endpoint.",MERGE,3.66
