140659,C3_Diff_Commit,P1_ZeroShot,0,0,"The PR introduces a new feature gate, implements an endpoint to track allocated pods, and adds tests for the functionality. These changes are significant and should be thoroughly reviewed to ensure they meet the project's standards and do not introduce any potential issues.",REJECT,2.89
