326709,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P1_ZeroShot,1,1,"The PR improves the user experience for dictation by replacing a spinning mic with a more intuitive download progress ring, which is easier to understand and visually appealing. The changes include adding a new action view item, updating context keys, and modifying CSS styles. The implementation is well-structured and follows best practices. The validation checks are also thorough.",MERGE,9.74
326709,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P2_FewShot,1,1,"The PR improves the user experience for dictation initial-download by replacing a spinning mic with a clearer, self-explanatory affordance. The changes include adding a download icon with a progress ring, an indeterminate fallback, and rich hover text. These improvements enhance usability and provide better feedback to users. The implementation is well-documented, and the validation checks are clean.",MERGE,10.66
326709,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P3_ChainOfThought,1,1,"The PR improves the user experience during the initial download of the on-device speech-to-text model for dictation. It replaces the spinning mic with a clearer, self-explanatory affordance that shows a progress ring and updates live. The notification is only shown when a screen reader is active, improving accessibility.",MERGE,8.25
326709,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P4_RoleBased,1,1,"The PR improves the user experience for dictation by replacing an ugly spinning mic with a clearer, self-explanatory download progress ring. This change enhances usability and provides more context to users during the initial download of the speech-to-text model.",MERGE,8.31
