191044,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P3_ChainOfThought,0,1,"The PR introduces two new toolchain kinds for Triton, a self-contained .c file with embedded cubin and grid baked in, and a generic driver-API launcher for RAW cubins. The changes include updates to the compile.c template and the addition of a raw-cubin launcher. The code also includes a test plan to validate the changes.",MERGE,9.78
191044,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P4_RoleBased,0,1,"The PR introduces two new toolchains for Triton, which are designed to compile code into self-contained .c files with embedded cubin and grid baked in. The launcher is a thin extern-C call, and module load is lazy inside the generated .c file. The second toolchain compiles to a RAW cubin and generates a generic driver-API launcher, which fixes limitations of the C-template path's per-device and exit()-on-error limitations. Both kinds honor explicit-arch export for GPU-less builders via a fixed-target driver shim.",MERGE,13.57
