326666,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P1_ZeroShot,1,1,"The PR introduces a feature that enhances user experience by allowing mentions of already attached context in prompts, which can improve communication and reduce redundancy. The implementation appears to be well-structured, with considerations for performance (lightweight state management) and accessibility. The addition of regression coverage is also a positive aspect, as it helps ensure the new feature does not break existing functionality.",MERGE,9.63
