326666,C2_Diff_PR_Body,P3_ChainOfThought,1,1,"The PR introduces a feature that allows users to reference inline attachments in their prompts, which can help avoid duplicating or removing attached content. It also keeps the inline reference state lightweight to prevent typing lag with large attachment payloads while preserving the original payload when sending requests. The feature prioritizes attached context in # and @ suggestions for easy discovery and reference. Additionally, it includes accessibility guidance and regression coverage.",MERGE,9.65
